#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer2d.rst:23 bcb460718bca486391b7992db9a2e480
msgid ""
"FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D is a 2D node that plays :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` "
"resources using the FMOD audio engine. It provides spatial audio capabilities in 2D environments,"
" with distance-based attenuation and panning relative to the camera/listener."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D 使用 FMOD 播放  :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>`  "
"资源，根据与相机或听者的相对位置计算二维距离衰减和声像。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer2d.rst:25 7b680783ee17448c8967e943007d4bea
msgid "Key features:"
msgstr "主要特性："

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer2d.rst:27 b65fa1109f794b399136c335b9f97d1f
msgid "2D spatial audio with distance attenuation"
msgstr "监听位置优先使用    ``FmodServer``    中记录的 2D 摄像机信息；如果没有记录，则尝试使用当前视口的   ``Camera2D``"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostreamplayer2d.rst:29 76cd93bb8c0248d499436ed2d2f3ef4d
msgid "Automatic panning based on position relative to camera"
msgstr "根据与相机的相对位置自动调整声像"

